Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.99,0:03:38.36,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be20}叶えてよ
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.62,0:03:46.37,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be20}もう少しだけ　待ってて
