Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.90,0:03:34.86,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be20}把血肉 心靈 盡數吞噬
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.99,0:03:38.36,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be20}拜託了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.62,0:03:46.37,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\be20}再等我一下 一下就好
